摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Self-evolving memory OS for LLM & AI Agents: ultra-persistent memory, hybrid-retrieval, and cross-task skill reuse, with 35.24% token savings and DeepSeek Harness support.","id":"gh:1014729376","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"MemOS","slug":"MemTensor/MemOS","topics":["agent","agentic-ai","ai","ai-agents","chatgpt","claude","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","hermes","llm","long-term-memory","mcp","memory","memory-management","openclaw","rag","self-evolving","skills","token-savings"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Self-evolving memory OS for LLM & AI Agents: ultra-persistent memory, hybrid-retrieval, and cross-ta"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"sk skill reuse, with 35.24% token savings and DeepSeek Harness support."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"MemOS 2.0 Stardust（星尘）"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Give your Agent persistent memory and the ability to grow."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> [!TIP]\n> **New: Connect MemOS to DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`)**\n>\n> Add automatic recall, background c"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"apture, hybrid retrieval, and a local Memory Viewer to DeepSeek Harness—powered by the same MemOS co"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"re used across agent ecosystems.\n>\n> **Get started →**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 👾 MemOS: Memory Operating System for LLM & AI Agents"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**MemOS** is a Memory Operating System for LLMs and AI agents that unifies **store / retrieve / mana"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ge** for long-term memory, enabling **context-aware and personalized** interactions with **KB**, **m"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ulti-modal**, **tool memory**, and **enterprise-grade** optimizations built in."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Key Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Unified Memory API**: A single API to add, retrieve, edit, and delete memory—structured as a gra"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ph, inspectable and editable by design, not a black-box embedding store.\n- **Multi-Modal Memory**: N"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"atively supports text, images, tool traces, and personas, retrieved and reasoned together in one mem"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"ory system.\n- **Multi-Cube Knowledge Base Management**: Manage multiple knowledge bases as composabl"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"e memory cubes, enabling isolation, controlled sharing, and dynamic composition across users, projec"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"ts, and agents.\n- **Asynchronous Ingestion via MemScheduler**: Run memory operations asynchronously "},{"id":"p9s7","text":"with millisecond-level latency for production stability under high concurrency.\n- **Memory Feedback "},{"id":"p9s8","text":"& Correction**: Refine memory with natural-language feedback—correcting, supplementing, or replacing"},{"id":"p9s9","text":" existing memories over time."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### News"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **2026-08-17** · 🐋 **MemOS Connects with DeepSeek Harness**\nMemOS now brings persistent memory to "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"**DeepSeek Harness** through both local and cloud plugins. DSH can automatically recall relevant con"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"text before a task and retain new experience after a successful turn, without modifying its core."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- **2026-07-02** · 🏆 **MemOS Advances Agent and User Memory Benchmarks**\nWith MemOS, **OpenClaw** im"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"proves average task completion from **36.63% to 50.87%** across five agent tasks. MemOS also achieve"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"s **88.83 on LoCoMo** and **89.20 on LongMemEval**, and leads in **OmniMemEval**, a unified evaluati"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"on of 14 commercial memory products across ten datasets."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **2026-05-09** · 🧠 **memos-local-plugin 2.0**\nOfficial local memory plugin for **Hermes Agent** an"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"d **OpenClaw**. One core powers self-evolving memory across L1 traces, L2 policies, L3 world models,"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" and crystallized Skills, with local-first storage and feedback-driven retrieval."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **2026-04-10** · 👧🏻 **MemOS Hermes Agent Local Plugin**\nOfficial Hermes Agent memory plugins launc"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"hed: Hybrid retrieval (FTS5 + vector), smart dedup, tiered skill evolution, multi-agent collaboratio"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"n. 100% local, zero cloud dependency."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **2026-03-08** · 🦞 **MemOS OpenClaw Plugin — Cloud & Local**\nOfficial OpenClaw memory plugins laun"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ched. **Cloud Plugin**: hosted memory service with 72% lower token usage and multi-agent memory shar"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ing (MemOS-Cloud-OpenClaw-Plugin). **Local Plugin** (`v1.0.0`): 100% on-device memory with persisten"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"t SQLite, hybrid search (FTS5 + vector), task summarization & skill evolution, multi-agent collabora"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"tion, and a full Memory Viewer dashboard."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 📊 Performance"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"MemOS leads across multiple benchmarks — evaluated against mainstream commercial memory products acr"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"oss 5 user memory and 5 agent memory tasks."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Benchmark       | Score |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| LoCoMo          | 88.83 |\n| LongMemEval     | 89.20 |\n| PersonaMem v2   | 40.58 |\n| HaluMem       "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"  | 80.91 |\n| BEAM-10M        | 56.75 |\n| GDPVal          | 62.07 |\n| LiveCodeBench   | 64.96 |\n| Om"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"niMath        | 61.00 |\n| SWE-Bench       | 38.46 |\n| BrowseComp-Plus | 23.85 |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Evaluated via OmniMemEval — https://github.com/MemTensor/OmniMemEval."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## 🎯 What MemOS Is For"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"MemOS gives AI agents long-term memory. Common uses:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- AI assistants with consistent, context-rich conversations\n- Customer support that recalls past tic"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"kets and user history\n- Personalized agents that adapt to individual preferences\n- Multi-agent colla"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"boration with shared or isolated memory"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## 🚀 Quick Start"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MemOS is built around four entry points. Pick the one that matches your scenario."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"|              | Cloud API               | Self-Host          | MemOS Cloud Plugin       | Local Plu"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"gin                                     |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Best for     | Your app, fully managed | Teams on own infra | OpenClaw users, zero ops | DeepSeek "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"Harness, Hermes, or OpenClaw; on-device |\n| Setup        | Get an API key          | docker compose "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"up  | openclaw plugins install | npm install + agent-specific setup               |\n| Infra needed |"},{"id":"p27s4","text":" None (hosted)           | Neo4j + Qdrant     | None (uses MemOS Cloud)  | None (local SQLite)      "},{"id":"p27s5","text":"                        |\n| Data lives   | MemOS Cloud             | Your servers       | MemOS Clou"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"d              | Your machine                                     |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### ☁️ Use the Cloud API (Hosted)"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"You want to add memory to your app through a fully managed service — no infrastructure to run."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"**1. Get an API key:**"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- Sign up on the MemOS dashboard.\n- Go to **API Keys** and copy your key (starts with `mpg-`). Keep "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"e MemOS dashboard.\n- Go to **API Keys** and copy your key (starts with `mpg-`). Keep it server-side."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"**2. Add and search memories:**"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"**Next steps:**"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- MemOS Cloud Getting Started — connect to MemOS Cloud and enable memory in minutes.\n- MemOS Cloud P"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"latform — explore the Cloud dashboard, features, and workflows."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### 🖥️ Self-Host the MemOS Service"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"You want to run MemOS as a REST service on your own machine or cluster."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"**Option A — Docker (recommended):**"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"The API is served at `http://localhost:8000`."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"**Option B — Run with uvicorn (without Docker):**"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"See `docker/.env.example-full` for all configuration options (LLM provider, embedder, vector DB, gra"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"ph DB, scheduler). The full deployment guide is at https://memos-docs.openmem.net/open_source/gettin"},{"id":"p43s3","text":"g_started/rest_api_server/."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"**Try the API:**"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
